Historical reference math
-------------------------

The former K3 parity component and its glibc/fdlibm reference math were removed
from the live source before v0.1.0. Their original authorship and LGPL notices
remain with the source snapshots in Git history; those historical notices are
not replaced by the repository's Apache-2.0 license.

External runtime dependencies
-----------------------------

liburing is not vendored. Binary distributions must comply with its selected
license (the MIT option is available) and the NVIDIA CUDA runtime terms.
No binary release is supplied by this source import.
